<title>FRANCE: French-German arts channel picks IP as marketer.</title>
<headline>French-German arts channel picks IP as marketer.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG, France 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French-German fine arts cable channel Arte said on Thursday it had selected IP Network as its Europe-wide marketing agency and foresaw a boom in sponsoring deals based on the new partnership.</p>
<p>IP Network has television marketing agreements across Europe and is, along with the German private network RTL's advertising marketer IP Deutschland, a unit of the French IP group in Paris.</p>
